  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_0126.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La pista de atletismo de l&#39;Ol&iacute;mpic ha sido escenario este viernes del maraton por relevos, organizado por el Club Atletisme Onda. Bajo un intenso calor, primero ha sido el turno de ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as, con varias pruebas, y despu&eacute;s la carrera reina.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0116.jpg\" alt=\"img_0116\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0117.jpg\" alt=\"img_0117\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0119.jpg\" alt=\"img_0119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0120.jpg\" alt=\"img_0120\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0121.jpg\" alt=\"img_0121\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0122.jpg\" alt=\"img_0122\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0124.jpg\" alt=\"img_0124\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0126.jpg\" alt=\"img_0126\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/maratorelleusclubatletismeonda/img_0127.jpg\" alt=\"img_0127\" style=\"max-widt